            "description": "beepSource: leader|all, syncSound: beep|voice|jingle. 안내음성+비프 샘플이면 leader / beep.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"beepSource\": \"leader\",\n  \"syncSound\": \"beep\"\n}"
            }
